@startuml
title Productos - CRUD + Reseñas + Control por rol

actor Usuario as U
actor Admin as A

participant "ProductsPage" as Products
participant "ProductDetailPage" as Detail
participant "ProductFormPage" as Form
participant "Backend /api/products" as ProdAPI
participant "Backend /api/users" as UsersAPI

== Listado ==
U -> Products : Entrar a /products
Products -> ProdAPI : GET /api/products (JWT si aplica)
ProdAPI --> Products : array productos
Products -> U : render cards (nombre, precio, estado activo/no activo)

== Detalle + reseñas ==
U -> Detail : Entrar a /products/:id
Detail -> ProdAPI : GET /api/products/:id
ProdAPI --> Detail : producto + reviews
U -> Detail : POST reseña (rating,comment)
Detail -> ProdAPI : POST /api/products/:id/reviews + JWT
ProdAPI --> Detail : reviews actualizadas

== Admin CRUD ==
A -> Form : Crear producto
Form -> ProdAPI : POST /api/products + multipart image + JWT (admin)
ProdAPI --> Form : producto creado

A -> Form : Editar producto
Form -> ProdAPI : PUT /api/products/:id + multipart image + JWT (admin)

A -> Products : Eliminar producto (desde card / detalle)
Products -> ProdAPI : DELETE /api/products/:id + JWT (admin)
ProdAPI --> Products : OK

note over Products,Detail
  UI muestra/oculta botones admin\nsegún $isAdminStore.
end note

@enduml

